   ------
Common X.509 Authentication Library - Java API
   ------
   
Common X.509 Authentication Library - Java API

  
	The Common Authentication Library provides foundation code for establishing secure
SSL/TLS connections and validating certificate chains.

	The library manual, including the functional description, programmer's guide, and
examples, is maintained as +src/main/doc/manual.txt+ in the source repository.

	The API documentation is available in Javadoc format. It is linked under 
the ''Project Reports'' section in the left menu.
